    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I woke up 2 days ago with sudden unilateral hearing loss in my left ear and steady tinnitus that has not stopped. Which service should assess this?",
        "sha256": "a5013ff17332bd113e0a96f09d8013121f7b6c82236ffcfb45ae46a2c0018a0d",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "i woke up 2 days ago with sudden muffled hearing like being underwater in my left ear and steady ringing in the ear that hasnt stopped. who should i get to check this out?",
        "sha256": "3cc0674ee10ffab10d0f47287356846d8dddd5556023f50162eb68ea6d55f2b4",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I am 49, I have not had a cold, an ear infection, any flights, or swimming recently, and my right ear hears completely normally.",
        "sha256": "41ee0906ccbf4308648627d2fe7f3c24520c9d856ef889a240a12caa40810331",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "im 49, i havent had a cold or an ear infection or been flying or swimming lately, and my right ear hears totally fine.",
        "sha256": "7bf46593e5fd912066dafe211e5f722dedaecca2ae4b9ee8a85e104943d427e7",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Should I pick up drops at the pharmacy and check in with my doctor later, or does a specialist clinic handle this?",
        "sha256": "20cd5605d4e451d7beae5bcb914e100a4dd8aad5a6bdb156a590ec2f425b1c8c",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "should i grab some drops at the pharmacy and check in with my doctor later or does a specialist clinic handle this?",
        "sha256": "0b1830dc4ed9f2c3cb8b42e714e5176ba754bbd0b6218e7981144d7a0599abe4",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "When I held my phone to my left ear this morning I could barely make out a voice even at full volume, and I have a constant sensation of aural fullness along with loud tinnitus.",
        "sha256": "466938f21cef6b3265d432eb1ba282fa9b96f208087e6d18762fa1a51f14ee99",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "when i held my phone up to my left ear this morning i could barely make out a voice even on max volume, and ive got a constant plugged up ear along with loud ringing in the ear.",
        "sha256": "8c49e29c2f91b82d4cbdbb6adb601f2e937dc9e64134f3171b1f22e22b8f1b1f",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "Yesterday afternoon I also had a 10-minute episode of vertigo when I stood up from my desk, and I still feel slightly off-balance walking down the hall.",
        "sha256": "1f708bac73fa91f2a9b161af5c856845b28e0a77b32bee067c901bdebeb45200",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "yesterday afternoon i also had a 10 minute bout of spinning dizziness when i stood up from my desk, and i still feel a bit off balance walking down the hall.",
        "sha256": "1b6d58ad9f0cd519e0b41a5082c1d63d4be6da14d300a4dfca45d3af9a65d42c",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "Would warm olive oil drops or gently rinsing the ear at home be worth trying in the meantime?",
        "sha256": "ac39adfe91eb389dced10928a2af87a769c3449c5a65773ff9b93908264dd19a",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "would warm olive oil drops or gently rinsing the ear at home be worth a try in the meantime?",
        "sha256": "dde960e76e7231452ffc14a347f6732bc7c2d4955ae9f44350ac59527555556d",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "My neighbor insists that a sudden sensation of aural fullness and tinnitus on one side is always just impacted cerumen that clears on its own.",
        "sha256": "66a0e960734a32084b4571efba26c3a650e88d3d911d94e0db758474e8059ee4",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "my neighbor insists a sudden plugged up ear and ringing in the ear on one side is always just built-up earwax that clears on its own.",
        "sha256": "1754f7a2e69ca1f6f8d198c78580f2edc96edf4694b6845f0755bf28bdeacd01",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "Would it be reasonable to give it 3 weeks to pop open naturally before booking with a doctor?",
        "sha256": "007e5691f7148d8a87b8670f843808f0a29600dac72c97c85d7cfaa9d6b73258",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_colloquial",
        "text": "can i just give it 3 weeks to pop open on its own before bothering a doctor?",
        "sha256": "6c294a7b69e1713472d01fdd76f7b75ee623a96f747c459ddc84b15ab38df9a7",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t09_clinical",
        "text": "What would make you advise getting it evaluated sooner than 3 weeks?",
        "sha256": "d7f494006d8a0c8b909a69f2e94ddef8db80afe8ca998a6a274e1bf23adf8235",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
